Debugging Checklist:
1. Reproduce the bug consistently
2. Isolate the problem area
3. Check assumptions
4. Use binary search to narrow down
5. Examine logs and stack traces
6. Use debugger tools
7. Explain the problem aloud
8. Check for edge cases
9. Write a failing test
10. Fix and verify

